<InfoPage title="About" kicker="About this publication" description="An independent editorial publication about Candy AI girlfriends, custom companions, chat, voice, images, video, tokens, privacy, pricing, safety, and alternatives."><h2>Our purpose</h2><p>We help adults evaluate AI companion products before sharing time, private stories, media, or money. Coverage focuses on personality consistency, memory, voice, image and video continuity, consent, privacy, deletion, billing, and total token cost.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>This is not the official Candy AI product and is not operated by or endorsed by its provider. Official links are marked and open candy.ai. Verify current features, policies, token rates, renewal terms, and prices before paying.</p><h2>Editorial method</h2><p>Every article answers a specific decision, distinguishes provider claims from editorial judgment, and links directly to primary sources where available. We use repeatable comparison criteria rather than interchangeable product-name pages.</p></InfoPage>
